# Sanity Studio config. Copy to studio/.env — the Sanity CLI loads .env from here.
#
# projectId is hardcoded in sanity.config.ts / sanity.cli.ts (it is public, and the
# Studio only ever talks to one project). Only the dataset varies.
#
# Defaults to `production` when unset, so `npm run deploy` ships the real dataset.
# Set to `development` locally so stock content and seed scripts never touch her
# real photos. See CLAUDE.md.
SANITY_STUDIO_DATASET=development
